"touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|GeneralLiu|MOOD2", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}, "510112": {"id": 510112, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|GeneralLiu_Live2D|HELLO", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"510101": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "510102": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "TIP", "caption": "Commander, um..."}, "510103": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "510104": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE2", "caption": "The sky...is so close, yet so far..."}, "510105": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "BREAK", "caption": "H-how could this be?"}, "510106": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu_Live2D", "voice_key": "MEET", "caption": "The enemy is here, should we open fire now?"}, "510107": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu_Live2D", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "This military saber was the masterwork of the best smith I could find, and it cost about...that much. You think it's expensive? It's not that bad though?"}, "510108": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "ALLHALLOWS", "caption": "Spirits and ghosts are all pretty scary, I think I'll pass... Just save me some candy."}, "510109": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "Commander, please let me know if there's something you'd like to eat. I've been learning how to cook recently, so maybe I might get a chance to practice... Hm? Anything will do?"}, "510110": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "I honestly didn't think I'd be able to come this far... Ah, that's not what I mean, I'm saying that I'm very happy! <> Although I'm not too good with words most of the time, I have always viewed you as a role model. <> Commander, it is an honor for me to take the next step as your companion!"}, "510111": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "MOOD2", "caption": ""}, "510112": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu_Live2D", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Hello, Commander... Should I begin patrolling the campgrounds now?"}}}